comments.body:
@acornett Does the original Dexcom app have anything in the EULA about reverse engineering?

Even if it does, that aspect of the EULA may be illegal per the DMCA if it is being done for interoperability purposes as is the case here.

Of course if Patrik's uploader uses libraries or software components extracted from the Dexcom application things get more difficult...

@tolot27 Can xDrip upload to Clarity (the title)?  I don't think so.
Shouldn't we close this request because it currently is not possible due to the limitation imposed by Dexcom?
There is nothing we can do to xDrip to resolve this, is there?
